OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drones play 'key role'
OL,4,Apreventing football disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice drones are playing a "key role"
OL,7,Fpreventing disorder at Premier League
OL,8,Ffootball fixtures in the West Midlands
OL,9,Fthanks to a #2m pilot.
OL,11,FThe project, partnered with West
OL,12,FMidlands Police, started at the end of
OL,13,Flast season and uses eye in the sky
OL,14,Fpolicing to give officers a greater
OL,15,Fview of what is happening outside
OL,16,Fstadiums, and ensure crowd safety.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
