OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice drones play 'key role'
OL,4,Apreventing football disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Premier League described the pilot
OL,7,Fas "really positive" in tackling
OL,8,Fpotential incidents as soon as they
OL,9,Foccur, by deploying officers where they
OL,10,Fare needed as footage is fed into a
OL,11,Fcontrol room in real time.
OL,13,FThe force currently uses drones at both
OL,14,Fof the region's top flight stadiums, at
OL,15,FAston Villa and Coventry City, and
OL,16,FWolverhampton Wanderers.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
